er what administration you're pulling out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2024 Q3","e":"plug","d":"2024-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Middleton","x":"And lastly, leveraging the price increases and yielding full annual benefits as these continue to expand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2024 Q3","e":"plug","d":"2024-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Middleton","x":"Sales growth, price increases, improved mix and continued cost downs will continue to improve operating cash flows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2024 Q3","e":"plug","d":"2024-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Shrestha","x":"So I think there's a lot of situation where it's really cost savings and a better value proposition for our customer and that's what's going to drive the growth for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2024 Q4","e":"plug","d":"2025-03-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Middleton","x":"These actions included targeted price increases, labor optimization, rooftop consolidations, improvement in production costs and leveraging our hydrogen platform with our new green hydrogen plant in Georgia coming online.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2024 Q4","e":"plug","d":"2025-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"Last night, we announced significant structural change to streamline our cost base through Project Quantum Leap.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2024 Q4","e":"plug","d":"2025-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"These measures are targeted to generate annualized cost savings of $150 million to $200 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q1","e":"plug","d":"2025-05-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"Let me start with some business highlights, followed by updates on cost actions, capital, tariffs, US policy, and then I'm going to hand it over to Jose to walk through Europe in-depth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q1","e":"plug","d":"2025-05-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"Turning to tariffs, recent actions from the current administration have increased duties on Chinese imports that impact our core product lines like GenDrive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q1","e":"plug","d":"2025-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Eric Stine","x":"You've also put through price increases for margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q1","e":"plug","d":"2025-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"With respect to cost savings, internally we launched a major program called Quantum Leap, targeting over $200 million in annualized run rate reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/plug-power-plug-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q2","e":"plug","d":"2025-08-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"Now our hydrogen generation business today has zero impact based on tariffs.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1093691/000110465925076487/tm2523215d1_ex99-1.htm"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q2","e":"plug","d":"2025-08-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"And when we do an evaluation of the impact of tariffs for our electrolyzer business, it's really in the range of 2% to 3%.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1093691/000110465925076487/tm2523215d1_ex99-1.htm"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q2","e":"plug","d":"2025-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"But between the price increases we've seen as well as the improved performance of the units with our increased focus really puts us on a pathway that I think we all feel comfortable that gross margin neutrality is achievable and, quite honestly, very easy to understand as we operate the business…","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1093691/000110465925076487/tm2523215d1_ex99-1.htm"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q2","e":"plug","d":"2025-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Middleton","x":"And when you look at the improvement, service is certainly contributing, but as a percentage of revenue, PPA and fuel and other things are contributing too, given the price hikes and the things that we're doing.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1093691/000110465925076487/tm2523215d1_ex99-1.htm"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q2","e":"plug","d":"2025-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Marsh","x":"…through operational efficiencies, cost reductions, and improved pricing discipline; two, streamline our operations by consolidating facilities, optimizing our manufacturing footprint, and accelerating productivity gains; three, strengthening the reliability and performance of our…","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1093691/000110465925076487/tm2523215d1_ex99-1.htm"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q2","e":"plug","d":"2025-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"InComm Conferencing","x":"Page of www.incommconferencing.com Project Quantum Leap remains central to these gains as we streamline our operations, consolidate facilities, and drive efficiencies across the business.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1093691/000110465925076487/tm2523215d1_ex99-1.htm"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q4","e":"plug","d":"2026-03-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul B. Middleton","x":"…throughout the year, and these actions were associated with Project Quantum Leap and included targeted price increases, labor optimization, rooftop consolidations, improvements in production costs, leveraging our hydrogen platform, and a clear focus on reducing our OpEx resource investment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/02/plug-power-plug-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2025 Q4","e":"plug","d":"2026-03-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul B. Middleton","x":"We have opportunities to look at our manufacturing processes and think about how to streamline those.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/02/plug-power-plug-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2026 Q1","e":"plug","d":"2026-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Middleton","x":"When you ramp electrolyzers as we have, as an example, we talked last year about a program we rolled out into the year which we called a new diffusion bonding process—that is just a microcosm example of cost-reduction opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/plug-power-plug-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2026 Q1","e":"plug","d":"2026-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Middleton","x":"On the service front, we have rolled out a lot of programs that are driving that per-unit cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/plug-power-plug-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PLUG 2026 Q2","e":"plug","d":"2026-08-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Middleton","x":"We are also recognizing benefits based on the tariff recoveries and reduced